# Interactive transactional CRE/MOVE gate for licensed BADA 4.2 data.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-direct
00:00:00.00>ECHO === PYBADATEM DIRECT STATE TRANSACTION GATE ===
00:00:00.10>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE DRPT,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.10>CRE DENF,A320-232,41.32,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:02.00>ENVELOPECHECKS DRPT CUSTOM ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:02.10>ENVELOPECHECKS DENF CUSTOM ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:02.20>ENVELOPE DRPT REPORT
00:00:02.30>ENVELOPE DENF ENFORCE
00:00:03.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-direct.csv
00:00:04.00>MOVE DRPT,41.50,2.50,FL450,90,250
00:00:04.10>MOVE DENF,41.52,2.50,FL450,90,250
00:00:04.20>PERFSTATUS DRPT
00:00:04.30>PERFSTATUS DENF
# Change only the creation default. Existing DRPT and DENF retain their policy.
00:00:05.10>ENVELOPE ENFORCE
00:00:05.20>CRE CREBAD,A320-232,41.34,2.10,90,FL100,600
00:00:05.30>ENVELOPE OFF
00:00:05.40>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:05.50>ECHO === EXPECT DRPT ACCEPTED, DENF ROLLED BACK, CREBAD NOT CREATED ===
00:00:06.00>HOLD
